\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Indian Rupee Nears All-Time Low Against US Dollar\b0\par\par\uc2 485 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 November 2011\par 13:03\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- Dollar touches INR52.16, highest since March 3, 2009\par \par \uc2 -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has limited ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, says government official\par \par \uc2 (Adds context in 2nd paragraph, updates exchange rate in 3rd paragraph, adds analyst's comment in 5th paragraph, government official's comment in 7th and 8th paragraph)\par \par \uc2 By Sudeep Jain\par \par \uc2 Of Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee came perilously close to its lowest-ever value against the U.S. dollar Monday, hurt by a sharp fall in local stocks and lingering concerns over the euro zone's economic problems.\par \par \uc2 The rupee has been Asia's worst-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and has weakened nearly 17% against the U.S. dollar this fiscal year that started April 1. A wave of risk aversion sparked by the euro-zone debt woes has prompted global investors to seek refuge in the safe-haven greenback, edging it higher against several \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  globally. India's gaping trade and budget deficits coupled with persistently high inflation are also weighing on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The dollar was at INR52.1600 late Monday in Asia, within sniffing distance of its record high of INR52.1950 on March 3, 2009.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bombay Stock Exchange\uc2 's Sensitive Index slumped 2.6% to end at a near seven-week low of 15,946.10.\par \par \uc2 The rupee's fall was exacerbated by frantic dollar-buying by importers on fears the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will weaken further, said Pramit Brahmbhatt, chief executive of Alpari India, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer.\par \par \uc2 The rupee's recent slide has prompted speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would step into the market to sell dollars, but the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has maintained that it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to smoothen exchange-rate volatility.\par \par \uc2 A senior government official said Monday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has limited ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to check the rupee's fall.\par \par \uc2 "The rupee cannot slide beyond a point," Economic Affairs Secretary R. Gopalan told reporters. "The [RBI's] ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also limited," he added.\par \par \uc2 The rupee's weakness could also be linked to a widening current-account deficit, arising from a gaping trade deficit. The current-account deficit in the April-June period more than doubled from the previous quarter to $14.1 billion due to a sharp decline in investments and a moderation in services exports.\par \par \uc2 Some Indian exporters, such as computer-services firm \uc2 Infosys Ltd\uc2 ., are penciling in the rupee to slip more against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Infosys\uc2  is avoiding long-term hedges and is taking short-term covers because of its call on the rupee, Chief Financial Officer \uc2 V. Balakrishnan\uc2  told Dow Jones Newswires.\par \par \uc2 --By Sudeep Jain, Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 6145 6123; sudeep.jain@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 --Prasanta Sahu and Mukesh Jagota in New Delhi and Dhanya Ann Thoppil in Bangalore contributed to this article. [ 21-11-11 1203GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020111121e7bl000re\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
