\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: RBI Unlikely To Use  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves Aggressively To Check Rupee Fall - Gokarn\b0\par\par\uc2 531 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 2011\par 09:28\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- Deputy Gov. Gokarn says \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unlikely to aggressively use \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to check rupee fall\par \par \uc2 -- Gokarn says not looking at defending a particular exchange rate\par \par \uc2 (Recasts the first paragraph, adds \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor's comments in 2nd, 8th and 9th paragraphs, background and context in 3rd, 4th and 6th paragraphs, rupee's level in 5th paragraph)\par \par \uc2 Nupur Acharya and Bijou George\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to use the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves aggressively to check the rupee's recent sharp fall, a deputy governor said Thursday, as the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hovers around its lowest level in nearly 32 months.\par \par \uc2 "To use up reserves aggressively to defend an exchange rate which may not be defensible beyond a point means that we end up with the same pressures and with a lower cushion [against external liabilities]," Subir Gokarn told the CNBC-TV18 television channel.\par \par \uc2 India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which stood at $314.665 billion as of Nov.4, are often seen as a buffer to fund a current-account deficit that the South Asian economy runs due to a yawning trade gap.\par \par \uc2 The rupee has been among the worst performing Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this fiscal year that began April 1 and has dropped 14% against the U.S. dollar. The rupee weakening comes at a time when Asia's third-largest economy is battling high inflation, slowing business activity and a rising import bill due to high crude oil prices.\par \par \uc2 The rupee was last trading at INR50.77 to a dollar. Wednesday, the local unit touched 50.95 to a dollar, its lowest level since March 31, 2009.\par \par \uc2 The local market has been expecting the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the rupee's depreciation but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has largely refrained from doing so.\par \par \uc2 Gokarn said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't looking at "defending" any particular exchange rate for the rupee as it is an almost freely floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The markets should manage volatility by using appropriate hedging tools, he said.\par \par \uc2 Gokarn also said that the government's move to enhance the limit of foreign investment into government and corporate bonds may also help reverse some depreciation in the rupee.\par \par \uc2 "That would be a consequence I would expect to happen, that being the underlying logic in terms of arriving at the decision [to increase foreign investment limits] apart from other issues about the debt," he said.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in the day, India raised the limit of foreign investment into government paper and bonds of non-infrastructure companies by $5 billion to $15 billion and $20 billion, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Later, talking to reporters on the sidelines of a conference, Gokarn said the RBI expects liquidity to remain tight over the next few weeks but was unlikely to use the cash reserve ratio to deal with it.\par \par \uc2 The RBI said Wednesday it plans to buy back INR100 billion of government bonds on Nov. 24 to ease banking system liquidity.\par \par \uc2 -By Nupur Acharya and Bijou George, Dow Jones Newswires; +91-22-61456117; nupur.acharya@dowjones.com [ 17-11-11 0828GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020111117e7bh000i9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
