\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee at 30-mth low on dlr buying; Europe weighs\b0\par\par\uc2 579 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2011\par 05:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Dollar demand from gold, oil importers hurts\par \par \uc2 * Local equities, euro cautious before key EU summit\par \par \uc2 * No signs on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - traders\par \par \uc2 (Updates to noon)\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Oct 21 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee dived to a 30-month low on Friday dragged by strong dollar demand from importers and caution rippling across equities and the euro on nervousness around euro zone crisis.\par \par \uc2 At 12:14 p.m. (0644 GMT), the partially convertible rupee\par \par \uc2 had lost 0.5 percent of its value from Thursday's close and was at 50.07/08 per dollar, after hitting 50.18, its lowest since April 29, 2009 in early trade.\par \par \uc2 Traders have hoped the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would step in and hold back the rupee from breaching the 50-mark, but so far, there has been no signs of any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , they said.\par \par \uc2 The rupee is now expected to move in a range of 50.00 to 50.25 in the day, traders said.\par \par \uc2 "There is a lot of demand for dollars taking into account the uncertainty surrounding Europe. Gold and oil importers too have been active and adding to the pressure," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a state-owned bank.\par \par \uc2 Oil is India's biggest import item and local oil refiners are the largest purchasers of dollars in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Gold traders in India, the world's top buyer of the precious metal, stepped up last minute purchases to stock for next week's festivals as prices fell for the fourth session in a row to their lowest level in more than six weeks.\par \par \uc2 Deep divisions between France and Germany mean they will make scant progress on strengthening the euro zone bailout fund at a summit on Sunday in a sign that Europe's leaders are still some way from getting a grip on the bloc's debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 So far this month, the rupee has weakened by more than 2 percent after erasing 8.8 percent of its value in the September quarter, and remains the worst performer among major Asian peers in 2011.\par \par \uc2 Indian shares were trading up 0.2 percent, but investors were edgy ahead of a European leaders meeting on the weekend to tackle the euro zone debt crisis that has cast a shadow on foreign fund investments.\par \par \uc2 So far in 2011, foreign funds have net sold around $222 million of local shares, data from capital markets regulator Securities and Exchange Board of India showed.\par \par \uc2 The euro was at $1.3753, lower from $1.3789 at end of rupee trade on Thursday and the index of the dollar against six major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  was at 77.004 points from 76.925 previously.\par \par \uc2 The one-month onshore forward premium on the rupee was at 25.50 points from 25.25 on Thursday, the three-month premium was 63.25 points from 61.75 and the one-year premium was 135 points, from 143.25.\par \par \uc2 The one-month offshore non-deliverable forward contracts\par \par \uc2 were quoted at 50.43, weaker than the spot rupee rate.\par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market , the most traded near-month dollar-rupee contracts on the National Stock Exchange, the MCX-SX and the United Stock Exchange were all at 50.1650. The total traded volume on the three exchanges was $2.78 billion.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Aditya Phatak; editing by Malini Menon)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-RUPEE/50  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020111024e7al00054\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
