\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank did not  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market in August\b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2011\par 14:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Oct 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not buy or sell dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in August, for the ninth successive month, continuing its hands-off approach, its monthly bulletin showed on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India (RBI) \uc2 has always maintained that it does not target any specific exchange rate and only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent excessive volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The RBI had last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in November, when it had bought $1.37 billion and sold $500 million, compared with purchases of $450 million in October.\par \par \uc2 On a net basis, that was the RBI's biggest monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since June 2009, when it had bought $1.04 billion.\par \par \uc2 The rupee moved in a band of 44.19 to 46.08 per dollar in August.\par \par \uc2 In 2010, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a net $1.85 billion, compared with net sales of $5.8 billion in 2009 when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the rupee from depreciating sharply.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, the partially convertible rupee ended at 48.975/985 per dollar, after touching a high of 48.895 and stronger from Friday's close of 49.1550/1650.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Shamik Paul; Editing by Harish Nambiar)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK-\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 /   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020111010e7aa000v8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
