\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank: to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  only to smoothen volatility-TV\b0\par\par\uc2 539 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 2011\par 07:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Cbank to stick to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to curb volatility- Gokarn\par \par \uc2 * Not looking at targeting particular level on rupee- Gokarn\par \par \uc2 * Rupee falls to lowest level in more than 28 mths\par \par \uc2 (Updates with rupee moves, quotes, background)\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Sept 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will maintain its stance of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market only to smoothen volatility, Deputy Governor Subir Gokarn told CNBC TV-18 on Friday, after the rupee touched its weakest level in more than 28 months.\par \par \uc2 "We at this point do not see any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from a rate targeting view point. That is something that would reflect a change in policy stance, which we are not doing at this point," Gokarn told the television channel in an interview from New York.\par \par \uc2 "If we do \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at all, it will be with a very narrow objective of smoothening what might be a very volatile market situation, nothing beyond that," he said.\par \par \uc2 Several analysts have called for the RBI to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in order to prevent the recent sharp depreciation in the rupee from fuelling imported inflation, which could add to already high domestic price pressures.\par \par \uc2 The RBI has always maintained that it does not use the rupee as a tool for inflation management. However, in its latest policy, it said a falling rupee may have adverse effects on inflation.\par \par \uc2 "One should not look at our exchange rate policy within the narrow boundaries of inflation management," Gokarn said.\par \par \uc2 "There is larger logic and context to our exchange rate policy and we have over the last few years allowed the rupee to float within the broader structural boundaries of debt limitations or debt restrictions, so that policy remains," he added.\par \par \uc2 His comments come on a day when the rupee hit 49.90, its lowest since May 14, 2009, and a day after it shed 2.5 percent to post its biggest single-day loss in nearly three years.\par \par \uc2 The local unit has declined nearly 12 percent from its 2011 high of 43.8550 against the dollar reached in late July.\par \par \uc2 At 12:08 p.m. (0638 GMT), the partially convertible rupee\par \par \uc2 was at 49.65/66 per dollar, off the day's low of 49.90 and 0.2 percent below Thursday's close of 49.57/58.\par \par \uc2 "It is important for people to recognise that volatility in the exchange rate is a part of the game now and your investment or return calculations have to take that into account and you have to decide how you are going to hedge that risk," Gokarn said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for eight straight months until July, latest \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 However, there has been speculation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market over the last few days that the RBI may have stepped in to support the local unit.\par \par \uc2 Several traders had said the RBI likely sold dollars on Thursday. However, this can only be confirmed when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  releases the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data for this month in November.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Swati Bhat; Editing by Aradhana Aravindan)\par \par \uc2 INDIA CBANK/  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110926e79n00090\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
