\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank needs to step up  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 -StanChart\b0\par\par\uc2 364 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 September 2011\par 11:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Sept 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs to more actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the rupee's fall as imported inflation rises and exchange rate volatility risks increase, said Standard Chartered Bank in a research note on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The increasing chatter about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes as the partially covertible rupee touched a two-year low of 48.24 to a dollar on Tuesday and remains the worst performer amongst the 10 major Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It has already weakened by over 7 percent so far this year.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in its mid-quarter policy review last Friday, said that the rupee's depreciation may have adverse implications for inflation.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers have suspected the RBI's presence in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent sessions, but it hasn't been significant to turn the rupee's fortunes.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stated position is that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to stem excessive volatility. But in recent years, it has largely let the rupee free unlike its Asian peers.\par \par \uc2 A bulletin released by the \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  on Sept. 13 showed it had not bought or sold dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for eight successive months including July.\par \par \uc2 But, the RBI's hands-off policy may have made the unit more vulnerable during periods of risk aversion, the report said.\par \par \uc2 Standard Chartered however said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is yet to signal that \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related risks have risen significantly.\par \par \uc2 This may be partly due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's higher tolerance and partly due to the liquidity implications of higher \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the note said. Higher \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will lead to a squeeze in rupee liquidity from the system, lowering system cash to "undesirable levels," it said.\par \par \uc2 "Hence, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to stay sporadic and low, aimed at addressing volatility rather than imported inflation risks," the report said.\par \par \uc2 At 2:50 p.m. (0920 GMT), the unit was at 48.11/12 per dollar after rising to an intraday high of 47.8375.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Aditya Phatak; Editing by Subhadip Sircar)\par \par \uc2 STANCHART-INDIACBANK/   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110924e79l0007z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
