\par\par \b \uc2 Global fears, easing prices to impact India cbank stance-deputy\b0\par\par\uc2 558 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 August 2011\par 11:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  * Emergence of world recession concern will have say - Subir Gokarn\par \par \uc2  * "Second recession was not in realm of probability" till recently\par \par \uc2  * No policy position of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent rupee movement -cbank \par \par \uc2  HYDERABAD, \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 5 (Reuters) - A softening trend in world commodity prices and emergence of global recession concerns could have an impact on the Indian  \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy stance, a deputy governor said on Friday.\par \par \uc2  "Fears of global recession have just re-emerged. I suspect that when we next meet in September, it will be an issue," Subir Gokarn, who handles monetary policy at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told reporters on the sidelines of an event in the southern city of Hyderabad.\par \par \uc2  "So far there have been concerns about the extent of the recovery not being strong. Second recession was not in realm of probability till very recently," he said, referring to fears about the U.S. economy.\par \par \uc2  His comments followed a massive sell-off across world stock markets on renewed concerns over the global economic health and heavy demand for safe-haven government securities.\par \par \uc2  The 30-share BSE index tumbled more than 3 percent on Friday morning to a near 14-month low and the rupee  slumped to a 5-week low at 44.8550 per dollar, joining a slide across Asian markets.\par \par \uc2  The benchmark overnight indexed five-year swap rate\par \par \uc2 slid to a more than 8-month low and the 10-year benchmark federal bond yield fell to a near two-week low of 8.29 percent.\par \par \uc2  The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India (RBI)\uc2 , which raised rates by a steeper-than-expected 50 basis points last week, has been one of the world's most aggressive central banks to fight high inflation by tightening policy.\par \par \uc2  It has raised rates 11 times since mid-March 2010 and bond traders had been pricing in another increase in September.\par \par \uc2  Gokarn said the RBI takes into account demand pressures and commodity prices for formulating its policy stance.\par \par \uc2  "We saw some softening of commodity prices in May-June but that trend did not persist and by the time we started July (policy) process they had stabilised," he said.\par \par \uc2  "Now, if this is a beginning of softening trend, it will have some impact on our thinking in terms of our stance," he added.\par \par \uc2  U.S. crude fell below $83 on Friday, heading for its biggest weekly drop since early May. Brent has dropped nearly 11 percent and U.S. oil by about 12 percent this week. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were expecting the RBI to step in and arrest a sharp fall in the rupee, but Gokarn said that an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could tighten liquidity in a banking system which is already running a negative cash condition.\par \par \uc2  "There is no policy position in terms of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent movement of rupee. The concern will be with liquidity. We don't want market to be disrupted by constraints of liquidity," Gokarn said.\par \par \uc2  At a separate event, another deputy governor of the RBI, K.C. Chakrabarty, said while it is not easy to move away from investing in U.S. Treasury, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is attempting to diversify its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to prevent any devaluation of its dollar assets.   \par \par \uc2 (Writing by Suvashree Dey Choudhury; Editing by Ranjit Gangadharan, Aradhana Aravindan)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-CBANK/GOKARN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110808e785000tw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
47
