\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: India  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 : Exchange Rates Should Be Aligned To Economic Fundamentals\b0\par\par\uc2 494 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 10:59\par \uc2 Dow Jones Asian Equities Report\par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 (Adds comments from RBI chief in 4th, 7th, 8th, 9th, 10th, 11th, 12th and 13th paragraphs, background in 5th, 6th and 14th paragraph)\par \par \uc2 By Sourav Mishra\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates should move in co-ordination with a country's economic fundamentals to keep tensions in the global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in check, the governor of the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be resorted to not as an instrument of trade policy, but only to manage disruptions to macroeconomic stability," Duvvuri Subbarao said at an event organized by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Sri Lanka in Colombo.\par \par \uc2 The speech was posted on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  website.\par \par \uc2 "The question boils down to what can surplus countries do domestically to increase consumption and what can deficit countries do domestically to increase savings."\par \par \uc2 The U.S. and other advanced economies have long been vocal about the need for China to devalue the yuan. China, on its part, has slammed developed economies for keeping their own \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  weak by practicing loose monetary policies.\par \par \uc2 But the spirit of co-\b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was evident when the G-7 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the yen, counterintuitively surging after the recent earthquake and tsunami, hit an all-time high of JPY76.25 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 "The crisis also taught us that given the deepening integration of countries into the global economic and financial system, uncoordinated responses will lead to worse outcomes for everyone," Subbarao said.\par \par \uc2 He said the spectre of protectionism will rise in the coming years and will take new forms.\par \par \uc2 Subbarao said that managing capital flows shouldn't be treated as an exclusive problem of emerging market economies, and advanced nations need to share the burden of adjustment.\par \par \uc2 Capital inflows--according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief--should meet two criteria: they should be stable and be roughly equal to the economy's absorptive capacity.\par \par \uc2 Capital controls, in some cases, can be an acceptable tool to manage capital flows, the governor said.\par \par \uc2 Subbarao said the global financial crisis has outlined the vulnerabilities of the U.S. dollar as a single reserve \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the use of the Special Drawing Right, or SDR, wasn't a feasible option as it had to meet several criteria.\par \par \uc2 "The SDR has to be accepted as a liability of the IMF, has to be automatically acceptable as a medium of payment in cross-border transactions, be freely tradeable and its price has to be determined by forces of demand and supply."\par \par \uc2 The SDR is a notional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that at present has only four constituents: the dollar, the euro, sterling and the yen. There has been demand that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the four largest emerging economies--Brazil, Russia, India and China--should all be included in the SDR basket.\par \par \uc2 -By Sourav Mishra and Khushita Vasant, Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 6145 6115; khushita.vasant@dowjones.com [ 29-03-11 0859GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument AER0000020110329e73t00014\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
