\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee at over 3-week peak; dollar losses help\b0\par\par\uc2 585 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2010\par 09:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Euro's rise vs dollar helps rupee surge to new 3-wk high\par \par \uc2 * A large foreign bank sells dollars, helps rupee-traders\par \par \uc2 * Cbank may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if rupee rise sharp, volatile-adviser (Updates to close)\par \par \uc2 By Swati Bhat\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 7 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee gained for a sixth straight session on Tuesday, rising to its highest level in more than three weeks, on the back of broad losses in the dollar versus majors, while some corporate dollar sales also aided.\par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> closed at the day's high of 44.64/65 per dollar, its strongest since Nov. 12, and 0.7 percent above 44.95/96 at close on Monday.\par \par \uc2 "Today's rally was quite a surprise really but there was a foreign bank selling large amount of dollars, likely for some big corporate client," said Naveen Raghuvanshi, group associate vice president and senior \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at \uc2 Development Credit Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "There is no real reason for being a rupee bull, but now that we have seen so much of a rally, 44.50-55 levels could be a strong support for the dollar, while on the top-side at 45.20-25 there could be some resistance," Raghuvanshi added.\par \par \uc2 Some traders see the local unit heading towards 44.50-44.20 levels and then weakening back towards 45. They also added one large corporate was unwinding long dollar positions on back of the rupee's recent rally.\par \par \uc2 Dealers, however, expect importers to come in to buy dollars sporadically around current levels. Oil <CLc1> is India's biggest import and refiners are the largest buyers of dollars in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "There is a possibility that some banks were heavily bought (had long dollar positions) seeing the euro downmove, so today's reversal, prompted them to cut those long positions here as well," a senior dealer with a private bank said.\par \par \uc2 The euro rose on Tuesday on optimism Ireland will pass an austerity budget later in the day, though support was expected to be fleeting, with the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  still dogged by structural weaknesses in the euro zone. [USD/]\par \par \uc2 The index of the dollar <.DXY> against six major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  was down 0.3 percent at 79.333 points when the rupee market closed.\par \par \uc2 The country's main share index <.BSESN> dropped 0.2 percent, weighed down by global macro-economic worries, while banks stocks fell on concerns rising interest rates would hit demand for loans. [.BO]\par \par \uc2 Foreign funds have invested more than $29.2 billion in Indian equities so far this year, driving the benchmark BSE index about 14 percent higher, while the rupee has gained over 4 percent.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if the rise in the rupee is sharp and volatile, Kaushik Basu, chief economic adviser to the finance ministry, said on Tuesday. [ID:nBMA009077]\par \par \uc2 One-month offshore non-deliverable forward contracts <PNDF> were quoted at 44.8, weaker than the onshore spot rate, suggesting a bearish near-term outlook.\par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market <INRFUTURES>, the most traded near-month dollar-rupee contracts on the National Stock Exchange, MCX-SX and United Stock Exchange closed at 44.8375, 44.8325 and 44.84 respectively, with total traded volume on the three exchanges at a low $5.8 billion. (Editing by Aradhana Aravindan)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE/ (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|SNI|SNS|RBN|ABN|M|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101210e6c7000hm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
